                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Paper Against Wind",
                                        "The permit clips\nare brass, broad,\nand heavier than\nexpected. An",
                                        "inspector designed\nthem after a roof\nvisit ended with\nthree pages in",
                                        "a chimney. The\noffice bought\nbetter clips\ninstead of banning\nroof",
                                        "inspections. A\nsmall practical\ntriumph, recorded\nwithout a slogan."
                                      ],
